{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press alt and Enter to play full-screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us and don't miss any related news! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu / Bilibili: Narcissus Cinnamon </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weibo: Narcissus Cinnamon Pro </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group \u2461: 1034255823 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Type: Suspense and Micro-Horror | AVG Visual Novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction: You wake up as a doctor in a mental hospital, entangled with three suspicious &quot;patients&quot; who appear by your side. Little by little, your past and memories are revealed... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the three male leads, one is a hidden character. Throughout the story, he wants to imprison you. Try to figure out who he is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he is not the only one with a captive ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkened, White Moonlight or Dropped from the Sky, Older or Younger, Love at First Sight or Can't Forget You After You Dumped Me, and More Tags Awaiting Your Discovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the one-by-one &quot;death&quot; flags, find the respective tokens of each &quot;patient&quot;, and send them home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various memory fragments, and you will gradually recall the truth... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010A meticulously crafted script of 150,000 words\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u301040+ Transition Images and CG\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u301012 opportunities for allocating action points\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[26 Memory Fragments (Short Stories)] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[25 Unique Outcomes] * Among the male leads, two each have 1 HE and 3 BE relationships, and the hidden male lead has 1 HE and 1 OE relationship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Duration of Gaming: 4 - 10 Hours\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Introduction: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/ba67e36fb360f317d939a8ee78df3736.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/ba67e36fb360f317d939a8ee78df3736.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The president's eldest son runs the company to great success, helps old ladies cross the road, and regularly donates to welfare institutions. I was dumped by you, but I still can't forget you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/e01607ab3f51b29e8e602770f029cbbc.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/e01607ab3f51b29e8e602770f029cbbc.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little brother, who works part-time at n jobs to support his studies and is very popular, has admired you for a long time. He deliberately got close to you and fell in love with you at first sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/5e4d626a1a1dfa590ee07075b814e762.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/5e4d626a1a1dfa590ee07075b814e762.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great actor, a childhood sweetheart who grew up with you and has strong feelings for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not paying attention to the possibility of another personality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Multi-branch narrative, your destiny is up to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key choices affect the ending: Every dialogue choice and interaction in the game can change character relationships and the direction of the story, unlocking a completely different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Favorability system (demo version has not been implemented yet) : Different characters with different favorability will trigger different dialogue, hiding plot lines for further exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/355e289d46747fdd96d7d3c88125738c.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/355e289d46747fdd96d7d3c88125738c.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Freely allocate action points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Different fields (worlds) during the day and night, the setting of action points allows different choices or choices to collide with different plots or meet different people (multiple points in individual locations will also trigger different plots)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/ae908a4b1cb20bb02e32c783a78d507f.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/ae908a4b1cb20bb02e32c783a78d507f.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Memory fragments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* By collecting memory fragments and unlocking forgotten memories, character relationships gradually emerge...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/f8b96dc15459b8b9210fd7d7ff97c692.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/f8b96dc15459b8b9210fd7d7ff97c692.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- -- --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production group information:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer/Art: Daffodil Cinnamon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriter: First quarter moon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program outsourcing: Black pineapple</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u91cc\u4e16\u754c\u7b2c\u4e00\u591c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/009fcb0a0bf6660af7ba479eddfdc2e5c7991004.jpg"},{"name":"\u6728\u5a49\u513f\u00b7\u798f\u5229\u9662\u7684\u56de\u5fc6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/ba2e0946e9bd3e780513f1d78da388441ac5b2e8.jpg"},{"name":"\u90a3\u601d\u00b7\u89e3\u8131","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/feb13bfb65dc4892a01613dd3936df67755132c5.jpg"},{"name":"\u738b\u6587\u6d69\u00b7\u5df4\u5c14\u7ef4\u75c7\u5019\u7fa4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/7638a145ce3d56988560a8c5c060443db3d55e7b.jpg"},{"name":"\u8c22\u5929\u00b7\u5fc3\u7406\u75bc\u75db\u969c\u788d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/d12a9d6c8e64e57a07205cfa0a69d05c55990cea.jpg"},{"name":"\u6c88\u79c0\u4e91\u00b7\u6447\u7bee\u66f2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595050/4c8e192674d30cc40087d45e04f0c992176e252b.jpg"},{"name":"\u7ec6\u8bf4\u56da\u7981","path":"https://cdn.aka