_paragraph\" >Key choices affect the ending: Every dialogue choice and interaction in the game can change character relationships and the direction of the story, unlocking a completely different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Favorability system (demo version has not been implemented yet) : Different characters with different favorability will trigger different dialogue, hiding plot lines for further exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/355e289d46747fdd96d7d3c88125738c.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/355e289d46747fdd96d7d3c88125738c.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Freely allocate action points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Different fields (worlds) during the day and night, the setting of action points allows different choices or choices to collide with different plots or meet different people (multiple points in individual locations will also trigger different plots)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/ae908a4b1cb20bb02e32c783a78d507f.avif?t=1771671732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras_big/ae908a4b1cb20bb02e32c783a78d507f.avif?t=1771671732 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Memory fragments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* By collecting memory fragments and unlocking forgotten memories, character relationships gradually emerge...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595050/extras/f8b96dc15459b8b9210fd7d7ff97c692.avif?